## Implementation selection rule

- Do not add improvements that are not in the current Issue's acceptance criteria to the same change.
- An Issue that the `Dependencies / blockers` of a P0/P1 Issue body names as a predecessor is a prerequisite of that work. Do not raise the predecessor Issue's Priority for the dependency alone.
- Include a separate problem found during Issue work in the same Issue only when it is required for the current acceptance criteria; first update the goal, scope and boundaries in the Issue body, and decide the grade again.
